  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.3\n\n            - [Bugfix] Handle default bool params correctly\n\n            1.4.2\n\n            - [Chore] Update package version\n\n            1.4.1\n\n            - [Bugfix] Broken CI Test Runner\n\n            1.4.0\n\n            - [Feature] Support Partial Types and Defaults\n\n            1.3.5\n\n            - [Bugfix] Avoid Nullable Reference Types in Generic Arguments\n\n            1.3.4\n\n            - [Bugfix] Add params modifier to method parameters\n\n            1.3.3\n\n            - [Bugfix] Exclude static interface members\n\n              Avoid generating code for static interface members; it is illegal to delegate an implentation\n              of a static member to an instance member.\n\n            1.3.2\n\n            - [Bugfix] Avoid nullability issues\n\n            1.3.1\n\n            - [Bugfix] Exclude names from method parameter equality checks\n\n            1.3.0\n\n            - [Feature] Support inherited members\n\n            1.2.2\n\n            - [Bugfix] Skip already implemented explicit members\n\n            1.2.1\n\n            - [Bugfix] Correct version metadata\n\n            1.2.0\n\n            - [Feature] Support Ref Parameters\n\n            1.1.1\n\n            - [Bugfix] Handle New Members in Adopted Interfaces\n\n            1.1.0\n\n            - Added index property delegation\n\n            1.0.2\n\n            - More documentation improvements\n\n            1.0.1\n\n            - Improved documentation\n\n            1.0.0\n\n            - Added project documentation and licensing.\n\n            0.2.0\n\n            - Support attaching [Adopt] to properties.\n            - Support events.\n            - Support nested interfaces.\n\n            0.1.0\n\n            - Initial version supporting attaching [Adopt] to members.",
